---
import '../../styles/email-marketing-workspace.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow, noarchive" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#06100d" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <title>Email Marketing Division — Sonny Court</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="loading-screen" id="loadingScreen" role="status" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="loading-card">
        <div class="loading-orb" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <h1>Le département se met au travail</h1>
        <p>Lecture sécurisée des campagnes, automations et segments MailerLite…</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="locked-screen" id="lockedScreen" hidden>
      <div class="locked-card">
        <div class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">✦</div>
        <h1>Accès privé</h1>
        <p>Cette pièce du Hub utilise la même session administrateur. Connecte-toi depuis le Hub pour voir les données MailerLite.</p>
        <a class="hub-link" href="/hub">Retourner au Hub</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <main class="workspace-shell" id="workspace" aria-busy="true">
      <header class="topbar">
        <div class="brand">
          <div class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">✦</div>
          <div class="brand-copy">
            <strong>Email Marketing Division</strong>
            <span>Sonny Court · Département agentique</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="topbar-actions">
          <span class="status-pill">Observation en direct</span>
          <button class="refresh-button" id="refreshButton" type="button">↻ Rafraîchir</button>
          <a class="hub-link" href="/hub">← Hub</a>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="observation-banner">
        <span class="shield" aria-hidden="true">⛨</span>
        <span><strong>Broadcasts verrouillés.</strong> Les agents analysent et proposent ; seule une épreuve isolée vers l’adresse test autorisée peut être préparée après ta double validation.</span>
        <small id="syncLabel">Synchronisation en cours…</small>
      </div>

      <section class="validator-home" id="validatorHome" aria-labelledby="validatorTitle">
        <div class="validator-welcome">
          <div>
            <div class="section-kicker"><span class="live-dot"></span> Mode validateur</div>
            <h1 id="validatorTitle">Bonjour Sonny.</h1>
            <p><strong id="validatorDecisionCount">La division prépare ton briefing.</strong> <span id="validatorTimeEstimate">Tu ne verras ici que ce qui réclame réellement ton attention.</span></p>
          </div>
          <button class="validator-department-button" id="openDepartmentView" type="button">Voir tout le département <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
        </div>

        <div class="validator-layout">
          <article class="validator-primary-card" id="validatorPrimaryCard" data-state="loading">
            <div class="validator-card-topline">
              <span id="validatorPrimaryKicker">Prochaine action</span>
              <span class="validator-safe-label">Sous ton contrôle</span>
            </div>
            <h2 id="validatorPrimaryTitle">Le briefing arrive…</h2>
            <p id="validatorPrimarySummary">Nova rassemble les informations utiles sans toucher à MailerLite.</p>
            <div class="validator-reason" id="validatorPrimaryReason">Aucune action externe ne sera exécutée silencieusement.</div>
            <div class="validator-primary-footer">
              <span><small>Temps estimé</small><strong id="validatorPrimaryTime">2 min</strong></span>
              <button class="validator-primary-button" id="validatorPrimaryAction" type="button" disabled>Patienter</button>
            </div>
          </article>

          <aside class="validator-side">
            <section class="validator-decisions" aria-labelledby="validatorDecisionsTitle">
              <div class="validator-section-heading">
                <div><span>Aujourd’hui</span><h2 id="validatorDecisionsTitle">Tes décisions</h2></div>
                <strong id="validatorDecisionBadge">0</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="validator-decision-list" id="validatorDecisionList">
                <div class="validator-empty">Aucune décision urgente pour le moment.</div>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section class="validator-team-status" aria-labelledby="validatorTeamTitle">
              <div>
                <span>Équipe en arrière-plan</span>
                <h2 id="validatorTeamTitle">Nova coordonne la division</h2>
                <p id="validatorTeamStatus">Les agents attendent les données du jour.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="validator-agent-strip" id="validatorAgentStrip" aria-label="Agents actifs"></div>
            </section>
          </aside>
        </div>

        <footer class="validator-signal" id="validatorSignal">
          <span aria-hidden="true">◎</span>
          <p><strong id="validatorSignalTitle">Signal du compte</strong><small id="validatorSignalDetail">Lecture des données MailerLite en cours…</small></p>
        </footer>
      </section>

      <div class="department-view" id="departmentView" hidden>
        <div class="department-view-heading">
          <div>
            <div class="section-kicker">Salle de contrôle approfondie</div>
            <h1>Tout le département</h1>
            <p>Équipe, métriques, autonomie, missions et journal de bord.</p>
          </div>
          <button class="validator-department-button" id="backToValidatorMode" type="button"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Revenir au mode validateur</button>
        </div>

      <section class="hero-grid" aria-label="Bureau des agents et briefing">
        <article class="panel office-panel">
          <div class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> Carte de l’équipe · 15 membres en service</div>
          <div class="hero-heading">
            <h1>Ton équipe email<br /><span>travaille sous tes yeux.</span></h1>
            <p>Direction au sommet, expertises par pôle. Sélectionne un agent pour suivre sa mission du moment.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="office-viewport" aria-label="Carte hiérarchique de l’équipe en pixel art">
            <div class="office-floor">
              <div class="office-room-label" aria-hidden="true"><span>EMAIL MARKETING DIVISION · TEAM MAP</span><i></i></div>
              <div class="department-map" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="department-zone department-zone--direction"></div>
                <div class="department-zone department-zone--editorial"></div>
                <div class="department-zone department-zone--intelligence"></div>
                <div class="department-zone department-zone--lifecycle"></div>
                <div class="department-zone department-zone--governance"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="department-label department-label--direction" aria-hidden="true">Direction</div>
              <div class="department-label department-label--editorial" aria-hidden="true">Pôle éditorial</div>
              <div class="department-label department-label--intelligence" aria-hidden="true">Intelligence &amp; revenus</div>
              <div class="department-label department-label--lifecycle" aria-hidden="true">Cycle de vie</div>
              <div class="department-label department-label--governance" aria-hidden="true">Gouvernance</div>
              <div class="agent-layer" id="agentFloor"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="agent-focus" id="agentFocus" aria-live="polite">
            <div class="agent-focus-identity">
              <span class="agent-focus-kicker" id="focusDivision">Direction</span>
              <h2><span id="focusName">Nova</span> <small id="focusRole">Directrice de division</small></h2>
            </div>
            <div class="agent-focus-mission">
              <span class="agent-focus-state" id="focusState">Initialisation</span>
              <p id="focusTask">Ordonne le briefing du jour.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="agent-focus-progress">
              <span><small>Progression</small><strong id="focusProgressValue">—</strong></span>
              <div class="progress-track"><span class="progress-bar" id="focusProgressBar"></span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <aside class="panel briefing-panel">
          <div class="briefing-heading">
            <div><div class="section-kicker">Briefing exécutif</div><p class="briefing-date" id="briefingDate">Aujourd’hui</p><h2>Ce qui mérite <span>ton attention.</span></h2></div>

            <div class="briefing-score">
              <div class="score-orb" id="maturityScore">—</div>
              <div>
                <strong id="maturityLabel">Évaluation en cours</strong>
                <p>Indice de maturité opérationnelle, pas une note de délivrabilité.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="briefing-list">
            <div class="briefing-line">
              <span class="briefing-line-icon" aria-hidden="true">✉</span>
              <span><strong>Dernier broadcast éditorial</strong><small>Envoi à 10 000+ contacts · rappels opérationnels exclus</small></span>
              <span class="briefing-value" id="lastBroadcastValue">—</span>
            </div>
            <div class="briefing-line">
              <span class="briefing-line-icon" aria-hidden="true">◫</span>
              <span><strong>File éditoriale</strong><small>Prêts + brouillons MailerLite</small></span>
              <span class="briefing-value" id="pipelineValue">—</span>
            </div>
            <div class="briefing-line">
              <span class="briefing-line-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</span>
              <span><strong>Tracking business</strong><small>Campagnes récentes instrumentées</small></span>
              <span class="briefing-value" id="trackingValue">—</span>
            </div>
            <div class="briefing-line">
              <span class="briefing-line-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌁</span>
              <span><strong>Connexion événementielle</strong><small>Webhooks actifs, URL masquée</small></span>
              <span class="briefing-value" id="webhookValue">—</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="metrics-grid" aria-label="Indicateurs principaux">
        <article class="metric-card"><small>Broadcasts sur 30 jours</small><strong id="metricCadence">—</strong><span class="metric-trend" id="metricCadenceTrend">Calcul…</span></article>
        <article class="metric-card"><small>Ouvertures pondérées · 90 j</small><strong id="metricOpen">—</strong><span class="metric-trend">Grands envois récents</span></article>
        <article class="metric-card"><small>Clics pondérés · 90 j</small><strong id="metricClick">—</strong><span class="metric-trend">Grands envois récents</span></article>
        <article class="metric-card"><small>Désinscriptions · 90 j</small><strong id="metricUnsub">—</strong><span class="metric-trend" id="metricUnsubTrend">Surveillance</span></article>
        <article class="metric-card"><small>Automations actives</small><strong id="metricAutomations">—</strong><span class="metric-trend" id="metricAutomationDetail">Lecture seule</span></article>
        <article class="metric-card"><small>Contacts inactifs repérés</small><strong id="metricInactive">—</strong><span class="metric-trend warn">À segmenter avec validation</span></article>
      </section>

      <section class="panel autonomy-panel" id="autonomyPanel" data-state="loading" aria-labelledby="autonomyTitle">
        <div class="autonomy-heading">
          <div>
            <div class="section-kicker"><span class="live-dot"></span> Moteur autonome</div>
            <h2 id="autonomyTitle">Le briefing démarre sans prompt.</h2>
            <p>Chaque jour, l’équipe lit les agrégats, détecte les signaux, archive son briefing et prépare le prochain dossier utile.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="autonomy-state" id="autonomyStateBadge">Initialisation</span>
        </div>
        <div class="autonomy-grid">
          <div class="autonomy-stat"><small>Dernier réveil</small><strong id="autonomyLastPulse">—</strong><span id="autonomyLastDecision">Aucun pulse enregistré</span></div>
          <div class="autonomy-stat"><small>Prochain réveil</small><strong id="autonomyNextPulse">—</strong><span>Planning quotidien sécurisé</span></div>
          <div class="autonomy-stat"><small>File du jour</small><strong id="autonomyMissionCount">—</strong><span id="autonomyMissionDetail">Signaux à analyser</span></div>
          <div class="autonomy-stat"><small>Budget IA mensuel</small><strong id="autonomyBudget">—</strong><span id="autonomyBudgetDetail">Plafond dur</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="autonomy-footer">
          <p><span>Zone verte uniquement</span> Analyse, rédaction et mémoire internes. Aucun brouillon, envoi, archivage de contact ou changement d’automation dans MailerLite.</p>
          <div class="autonomy-actions">
            <button class="mission-secondary-button" id="toggleAutonomy" type="button">Mettre en pause</button>
            <button class="mission-primary-button" id="runAutonomyNow" type="button">Lancer le briefing maintenant</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel first-flight-panel" id="firstFlightPanel" data-state="idle" aria-labelledby="firstFlightTitle">
        <div class="first-flight-heading">
          <div>
            <div class="section-kicker"><span class="live-dot"></span> Premier vol · Email de valeur</div>
            <h2 id="firstFlightTitle">Vis tout le cycle depuis ce cockpit.</h2>
            <p id="firstFlightSummary">L’équipe choisit l’angle, recommande l’audience, rédige et contrôle. Tu corriges, valides, puis tu peux recevoir une épreuve isolée.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="first-flight-state" id="firstFlightState">Prêt à démarrer</span>
        </div>
        <div class="first-flight-route" aria-label="Parcours du premier email">
          <article id="firstFlightStepAgents" data-state="current"><span>01</span><strong>Agents</strong><small>Angle + rédaction</small></article>
          <article id="firstFlightStepDossier" data-state="locked"><span>02</span><strong>Dossier</strong><small>Ta validation</small></article>
          <article id="firstFlightStepContent" data-state="locked"><span>03</span><strong>Contenu</strong><small>Correction libre</small></article>
          <article id="firstFlightStepProof" data-state="locked"><span>04</span><strong>Épreuve</strong><small>1 adresse autorisée</small></article>
          <article id="firstFlightStepBroadcast" data-state="locked"><span>05</span><strong>Broadcast</strong><small>Reste verrouillé</small></article>
        </div>
        <div class="first-flight-brief">
          <div><small>Audience recommandée</small><strong id="firstFlightAudience">Analyse en cours…</strong><span id="firstFlightAudienceReason">Aucun destinataire ne sera contacté pendant la préparation.</span></div>
          <div><small>Adresse d’épreuve</small><strong id="firstFlightRecipient">sonnycourt@gmail.com</strong><span>Fixée côté serveur · impossible à remplacer dans l’interface.</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="first-flight-actions">
          <button class="mission-primary-button" id="startFirstFlight" type="button">Faire produire la V2</button>
          <button class="mission-secondary-button" id="openFirstFlightDossier" type="button" disabled>Ouvrir le dossier</button>
          <button class="mission-secondary-button" id="openFirstFlightStudio" type="button" disabled>Ouvrir l’éditeur</button>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel mission-room" aria-labelledby="missionRoomTitle">
        <div class="mission-room-header">
          <div>
            <div class="section-kicker">Salle des missions</div>
            <h2 id="missionRoomTitle">Le travail réel de la division.</h2>
            <p>Les agents analysent, rédigent et préparent les dossiers. L’écriture d’un brouillon et l’envoi final restent deux actions séparées, chacune sous ton contrôle.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mission-counters" aria-label="État des missions">
            <div><strong id="missionWorkingCount">—</strong><span>En cours</span></div>
            <div><strong id="missionReviewCount">—</strong><span>À valider</span></div>
            <div><strong id="missionQueuedCount">—</strong><span>En attente</span></div>
            <div><strong id="missionDoneCount">—</strong><span>Terminées</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mission-room-grid">
          <article class="mission-feature" id="missionFeature">
            <div class="mission-feature-topline">
              <span class="mission-priority" id="featuredMissionPriority">P1</span>
              <span class="mission-status" id="featuredMissionStatus">Initialisation</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mission-feature-heading">
              <div>
                <span class="mission-owner" id="featuredMissionOwner">Mission pilotée par Alma</span>
                <h3 id="featuredMissionTitle">Préparation du prochain broadcast</h3>
                <p id="featuredMissionSummary">Les agents établissent le dossier de mission…</p>
              </div>
              <div class="mission-progress-orb" id="featuredMissionProgress">—</div>
            </div>

            <div class="mission-proof-grid" id="featuredMissionEvidence"></div>

            <div class="mission-pipeline-wrap">
              <div class="mission-subheading"><span>Chaîne de production</span><small>Chaque étape possède un responsable clair</small></div>
              <div class="mission-pipeline" id="missionPipeline"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="mission-feature-footer">
              <div><small>Livrable attendu</small><strong id="featuredMissionDeliverable">—</strong></div>
              <button class="mission-primary-button" id="openFeaturedMission" type="button">Ouvrir le dossier</button>
            </div>
          </article>

          <aside class="mission-portfolio" aria-label="Portefeuille de missions">
            <div class="mission-portfolio-heading">
              <div><span>Portefeuille</span><small id="missionPortfolioLabel">Synchronisation…</small></div>
              <span class="mission-safe-badge">Validation humaine</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mission-list" id="missionList">
              <div class="empty-state">Nova organise la file de missions…</div>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="dashboard-grid">
        <article class="panel work-panel">
          <div class="card-title-row">
            <div><div class="section-kicker">File de validation</div><h2>Décisions préparées pour toi</h2><p>Des recommandations lisibles, jamais exécutées silencieusement.</p></div>
            <span class="count-badge" id="priorityCount">0</span>
          </div>
          <div class="priority-list" id="priorityList"><div class="empty-state">Les agents établissent les priorités…</div></div>
        </article>

        <article class="panel work-panel">
          <div class="card-title-row">
            <div><div class="section-kicker">Journal de bord</div><h2>Ce que l’équipe vient de faire</h2><p>Chaque analyse reste traçable.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="activity-feed" id="activityFeed"></div>
        </article>

        <article class="panel guardrail-panel span-full">
          <div>
            <div class="section-kicker">Périmètre inviolable</div>
            <h2>Les automations restent sous ton contrôle.</h2>
            <p>La division peut préparer des broadcasts et, une fois armée, synchroniser des brouillons. Elle ne peut jamais modifier une automation et aucun envoi ne part sans ta validation finale.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="guardrail-grid">
            <div class="guardrail-item"><span class="guardrail-check">✓</span> Analyse MailerLite en lecture seule</div>
            <div class="guardrail-item"><span class="guardrail-check">✓</span> Passerelle d’écriture séparée et désarmée</div>
            <div class="guardrail-item"><span class="guardrail-check">✓</span> Automations non modifiables</div>
            <div class="guardrail-item"><span class="guardrail-check">✓</span> Double validation avant diffusion</div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="panel work-panel">
          <div class="card-title-row">
            <div><div class="section-kicker">Radar automations</div><h2>Signaux à investiguer</h2><p>Diagnostic seulement — aucun changement n’est possible.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="signal-grid">
            <div class="signal-card"><small>Signal fort</small><strong id="strongAutomation">Analyse en cours</strong><span id="strongAutomationRate">—</span></div>
            <div class="signal-card weak"><small>Point de vigilance</small><strong id="weakAutomation">Analyse en cours</strong><span id="weakAutomationRate">—</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="briefing-line">
            <span class="briefing-line-icon" aria-hidden="true">⚑</span>
            <span><strong>Alertes techniques remontées</strong><small>Warnings déclarés par MailerLite</small></span>
            <span class="briefing-value" id="automationWarnings">—</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="panel work-panel">
          <div class="card-title-row">
            <div><div class="section-kicker">Architecture data</div><h2>Base observée</h2><p>Inventaire sans consultation des fiches abonnés.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="briefing-list">
            <div class="briefing-line"><span class="briefing-line-icon">◌</span><span><strong>Segments dynamiques</strong><small>Règles d’audience existantes</small></span><span class="briefing-value" id="segmentCount">—</span></div>
            <div class="briefing-line"><span class="briefing-line-icon">◇</span><span><strong>Groupes</strong><small>Points d’entrée et cohortes</small></span><span class="briefing-value" id="groupCount">—</span></div>
            <div class="briefing-line"><span class="briefing-line-icon">⌘</span><span><strong>Champs disponibles</strong><small>Potentiel de personnalisation</small></span><span class="briefing-value" id="fieldCount">—</span></div>
            <div class="briefing-line"><span class="briefing-line-icon">●</span><span><strong>Actifs sur 6 mois</strong><small>Si le segment existe</small></span><span class="briefing-value" id="activeSixMonths">—</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="panel work-panel span-full">
          <div class="card-title-row">
            <div><div class="section-kicker">Campagnes récentes</div><h2>Derniers signaux éditoriaux</h2><p>Noms, volumes et performances agrégées uniquement.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div style="overflow-x:auto">
            <table class="campaign-table">
              <thead><tr><th>Campagne</th><th>Envoyés</th><th>Ouvertures</th><th>Clics</th><th>Désinscr.</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody id="campaignRows"><tr><td colspan="5">Chargement des campagnes…</td></tr></tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>
      </div>
    </main>

    <div class="toast" id="toast" hidden role="status"></div>

    <dialog class="review-dialog" id="reviewDialog">
      <div class="dialog-inner">
        <div class="dialog-owner"><span id="dialogOwner">Recommandation</span><button class="dialog-close" id="dialogClose" type="button" aria-label="Fermer">×</button></div>
        <h2 id="dialogTitle"></h2>
        <p id="dialogDetail"></p>
        <div class="dialog-evidence" id="dialogEvidence"></div>
        <div class="dialog-lock">⛨ Recommandation en lecture seule. Les validations locales se font depuis la Salle des missions et ne déclenchent aucune action MailerLite.</div>
      </div>
    </dialog>

    <dialog class="agent-profile-dialog" id="agentProfileDialog" aria-labelledby="agentProfileName">
      <div class="agent-profile-shell">
        <div class="dialog-owner agent-profile-owner">
          <span><i aria-hidden="true"></i> Fiche membre · Email Marketing Division</span>
          <button class="dialog-close" id="agentProfileClose" type="button" aria-label="Fermer la fiche de l’agent">×</button>
        </div>

        <div class="agent-profile-hero">
          <div class="agent-profile-portrait" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="agent-profile-avatar"></span>
            <small>Agent IA · En service</small>
          </div>
          <div class="agent-profile-identity">
            <span class="agent-profile-division" id="agentProfileDivision">Direction</span>
            <h2 id="agentProfileName">Nova</h2>
            <strong id="agentProfileRole">Directrice de division</strong>
            <p id="agentProfileSummary"></p>
            <div class="agent-profile-status"><i aria-hidden="true"></i><span id="agentProfileState">En service</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <section class="agent-profile-responsibilities">
          <div class="agent-profile-section-title"><span>Compétences</span><strong>Ce que fait cet agent concrètement</strong></div>
          <ul id="agentProfileResponsibilities"></ul>
        </section>

        <section class="agent-profile-command">
          <div>
            <span>Commande directe</span>
            <strong>Une idée précise ? Mets cet agent en mission.</strong>
            <p>Son rapport reviendra dans ta file de validation. Aucune action externe ne sera exécutée.</p>
          </div>
          <button class="agent-command-button" id="openAgentMissionComposer" type="button"><span aria-hidden="true">▶</span> Confier une mission</button>
        </section>

        <section class="agent-profile-mission-history" id="agentProfileMissionHistory" hidden>
          <div class="agent-profile-section-title"><span>Commandes récentes</span><strong>Missions confiées à cet agent</strong></div>
          <div id="agentProfileMissionList"></div>
